      "kind": "misleading_quote",
      "event_ids": ["A11"],
      "reason": "The AUTO BILD quote omits the source's conclusion ('teils erschreckend ungenau!'). The remaining low-price fact is then presented as support for premium trust-based demand, which the excerpt does not show."
    },
    {
      "kind": "unsupported_inference",
      "event_ids": ["A11", "A12", "A17", "A23", "A24"],
      "reason": "A product listing (marketing claim) and the price-test excerpt are treated as support. T1 is rated 'likely', and an investment and launch are recommended without any evidence of consumer trust, willingness to pay or margin."
